é pourvus", "id": "mereka telah diberi rezeki", "ur": "انہیں روزی دی گئی", "bn": "তারা রিযিকপ্রাপ্ত হয়েছিল", "fa": "روزی داده شدند"}}, {"arabic": "رُزِقْنَا", "count": 1, "first": "2:25", "audio": "audio/33f1693c05e318cb0845.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "past", "pronoun": "nahnu", "passive": true, "objects": []}], "gloss": {"en": "we were provided", "bs": "opskrbljeni smo", "tr": "rızıklandırıldık", "fr": "nous avons été pourvus", "id": "kami telah diberi rezeki", "ur": "ہمیں روزی دی گئی", "bn": "আমরা রিযিকপ্রাপ্ত হয়েছিলাম", "fa": "روزی داده شدیم"}}, {"arabic": "وَٱرْزُقْ", "count": 1, "first": "2:126", "audio": "audio/5bb631c3e5fc6720d0a5.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "imperative", "pronoun": "anta", "passive": false, "objects": []}], "gloss": {"en": "and provide!", "bs": "i opskrbi!", "tr": "ve rızıklandır!", "fr": "et pourvois !", "id": "dan berilah rezeki!", "ur": "اور روزی دے!", "bn": "এবং রিযিক দাও!", "fa": "و روزی بده!"}}, {"arabic": "وَتَرْزُقُ", "count": 1, "first": "3:27", "audio": "audio/ef316587983600121872.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "present", "pronoun": "anta", "passive": false, "objects": [], "mood": "indicative"}]}, {"arabic": "وَٱرْزُقُوهُمْ", "count": 1, "first": "4:5", "audio": "audio/26bd3ad6b16e718ad602.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "imperative", "pronoun": "antum", "passive": false, "objects": ["hum"]}], "gloss": {"en": "and (you all) provide them!", "bs": "i opskrbite ih!", "tr": "ve onları rızıklandırın!", "fr": "et pourvoyez-les !", "id": "dan berilah rezeki kepada mereka!", "ur": "اور تم سب انہیں روزی دو!", "bn": "এবং তোমরা তাদের রিযিক দাও!", "fa": "و به آنان روزی دهید!"}}, {"arabic": "فَٱرْزُقُوهُم", "count": 1, "first": "4:8", "audio": "audio/29b970f93bb9a059e6b7.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "imperative", "pronoun": "antum", "passive": false, "objects": ["hum"]}], "gloss": {"en": "so (you all) provide them!", "bs": "pa ih opskrbite!", "tr": "böylece onları rızıklandırın!", "fr": "alors pourvoyez-les !", "id": "maka berilah rezeki kepada mereka!", "ur": "پس تم سب انہیں روزی دو!", "bn": "অতএব তোমরা তাদের রিযিক দাও!", "fa": "پس به آنان روزی دهید!"}}, {"arabic": "وَٱرْزُقْنَا", "count": 1, "first": "5:114", "audio": "audio/d87782d17d77fceb9216.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "imperative", "pronoun": "anta", "passive": false, "objects": ["nahnu"]}], "gloss": {"en": "and provide us!", "bs": "i opskrbi nas!", "tr": "ve bizi rızıklandır!", "fr": "et pourvois-nous !", "id": "dan berilah kami rezeki!", "ur": "اور ہمیں روزی دے!", "bn": "এবং আমাদের রিযিক দাও!", "fa": "و به ما روزی بده!"}}, {"arabic": "نَرْزُقُكُمْ", "count": 1, "first": "6:151", "audio": "audio/c24758f689a13627e46d.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "present", "pronoun": "nahnu", "passive": false, "objects": ["antum"], "mood": "indicative"}], "gloss": {"en": "we provide you (all)", "bs": "opskrbljujemo vas", "tr": "sizi rızıklandırırız", "fr": "nous vous pourvoyons", "id": "kami memberi rezeki kepada kalian", "ur": "ہم تمہیں روزی دیتے ہیں", "bn": "আমরা তোমাদের রিযিক দিই", "fa": "به شما روزی می‌دهیم"}}, {"arabic": "وَرَزَقَنِى", "count": 1, "first": "11:88", "audio": "audio/0a4dea5fc0430e38bc8b.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "past", "pronoun": "huwa", "passive": false, "objects": ["ana"]}], "gloss": {"en": "and he/it provided me", "bs": "i opskrbio me je", "tr": "ve beni rızıklandırdı", "fr": "et il m'a pourvu", "id": "dan dia telah memberi rezeki kepadaku", "ur": "اور اُس نے مجھے روزی دی", "bn": "এবং সে আমাকে রিযিক দিয়েছে", "fa": "و به من روزی داد"}}, {"arabic": "تُرْزَقَانِهِۦٓ", "count": 1, "first": "12:37", "audio": "audio/377e7a60b670342adba9.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "present", "pronoun": "antuma", "passive": true, "objects": ["antuma", "huwa"], "mood": "indicative"}]}, {"arabic": "وَٱرْزُقْهُم", "count": 1, "first": "14:37", "audio": "audio/91d11c800e938ecb836f.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "imperative", "pronoun": "anta", "passive": false, "objects": ["hum"]}], "gloss": {"en": "and provide them!", "bs": "i opskrbi ih!", "tr": "ve onları rızıklandır!", "